# Compile with:
#   uv pip compile requirements/wimse-cta-mcp-guard-fixed.in --generate-hashes --universal \
#     --python-version 3.11 -o requirements/wimse-cta-mcp-guard-fixed.txt
# The fixed job in .github/workflows/wimse-cta-mcp-guard-conformance.yml
# installs this exact package set. The three pinned packages are the released
# versions exercised by the adapter, tests, and example. The two agentrust-io
# pins must equal tested_against in integrations/wimse-cta-mcp-guard/integration.yaml.
# rfc8785, pytest, and packaging are the integration's direct runtime and test
# dependencies, which the --no-deps editable install does not pull in.
# The floating job remains unpinned on purpose for drift detection.
